refsection.para:
FilenameStyle = LegacyData preserves the previous
    naming and grouping: one object uses ObjectName.ObjectType.data;
    multiple objects share Object1_Object2.data.

The Mission Tree command editor provides a default-filename selector
    and an optional output-file chooser. Save records runtime resource values;
    repeated execution in the same mission appends another snapshot.

programlisting.code:
Save Sat;
Save Sat {FilenameStyle = LegacyData};
Save Sat Fuel {Filename = 'Mission snapshot.script'};

Create Spacecraft Sat;
BeginMissionSequence;
Save Sat;
